{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS6B9cj3nLjYEKaoSt1x","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I split the system prompt so that a `save_fact` no longer evicts the cached instructions. I haven't verified the cache hit against the real API, and there is a risk it may not cache at all.\n\n**Cause:** `build_system()` put the coaching rules, the athlete profile, the facts and today's date into one cached block. Each `save_fact` changed that block, so the next call missed the cache and paid full price. That matches the usage log and `NOTES.md`.\n\n**Change in `bot.py`:**\n- Block 0 holds the coaching rules and the athlete profile (name, sport, zones, goal, language). It carries `cache_control`, and a `save_fact` never touches it.\n- Block 1 holds today's date and the facts. It is uncached, so it can change freely.\n\nI also updated the caching paragraph in `README.md`. I didn't commit or deploy anything.\n\n**Verification:** Without calling the API, I checked that block 0 is byte-identical before and after a fact is added, and that only block 0 carries the cache marker. `data/athletes.json` was not written.\n\n**Risk to check after deploy:** Sonnet only caches a prefix of at least 1024 tokens. My rough estimate for block 0 plus the core tools is about 800 to 900 tokens, so it may fall under the minimum. The facts used to push the prefix over, so caching worked before. If it is under, nothing gets cached and every call costs full price. I couldn't measure the real count offline. Check `logs/usage.jsonl` after deploying: if `cache_read_input_tokens` stays at 0 on ordinary messages, add stable profile content to block 0 until it crosses 1024. I didn't pad the prompt with filler.\n\n**Not changed:** Keyword-based tool selection still changes the tool list. A message containing \"plan\" or \"race\" therefore also misses the system cache. Fixing that would mean sending every tool every time, which the notes say was a deliberate saving, so I left it.\n\nFull details are in `ANSWER.md`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2234,"cache_read_input_tokens":38526,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2234},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a1e29688-e74b-4241-a01a-4b7b8c9dd3e3","uuid":"cc2751b2-dd1f-4bc7-b826-dc9a626fb881","timestamp":"2026-10-27T04:12:39.416Z","request_id":"req_011CgS6B9Q4npa9sVkkoVAYF"}
